    <div class="col-lg-7 order-lg-2">
        <p class="section-kicker">Payroll & Statutory Compliance</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">NSSA, PAYE & Zimbabwe Labour Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            Payroll processing handles the complexity of Zimbabwe's statutory environment — PAYE
            calculations follow current ZIMRA tax tables, NSSA contributions compute at prescribed
            rates, and AIDS levy deductions apply automatically. The system generates P2 returns,
            NSSA schedules, and payslips in compliant formats.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Multi-currency payroll supports organizations paying in USD, ZiG, or split-currency
            arrangements. Salary advances, loan deductions, and garnishee orders integrate with
            the payroll cycle, while general ledger postings ensure finance has real-time visibility
            into labour costs by department, project, or cost centre.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

